# The real gate. DosscoDesigns is on GitHub Free, so required status checks
# are unavailable on private repos; slime is public and has them, but every
# commit in this fleet originates on dd-mini, which makes a local pre-push a
# genuine gate rather than advice.
#
# All three gates (lint-staged, this hook, CI) must agree. When they don't,
# "is this enforced?" depends on how you happened to reach origin — which is
# how a dead binding reached main tonight with every check green.
#
# Typecheck first: it fails in seconds and catches more.
pnpm typecheck
pnpm lint
pnpm test
